meta {
  name: List of Couriers
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/courier/courierListWithCounts
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Use this API to check the list of couriers and the related information with Shiprocket based on the search criteria.
  **Note:**

  - This API will work on a company level.

  - You can use filters to sort your data. By default, all the couriers are shown if no filter is used.

  - total_courier_count will change based on the filter used.

  ##### Parameters:

  | **PARAMS** | **REQUIRED** | **DATA TYPE** | **DESCRIPTION** | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `type` | NO | _string_ | Use this as a parameter. Possible values are : active/inactive/all | [https://apiv2.shiprocket.in/v1/external/courier/courierListWithCounts?type=active](https://apiv2.shiprocket.in/v1/external/courier/courierListWithCounts?type=active') |
}
